  m_text: "<b><color=#FFD166>- [Fearsome] (\u0110\xE1ng S\u1EE3):</color></b> Qu\xE2n
    b\xE0i s\u1EDF h\u1EEFu hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng n\xE0y ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1ECB
    ch\u1EB7n (block) b\u1EDFi c\xE1c qu\xE2n \u0111\u1ECBch c\xF3 t\u1EEB 3 S\u1EE9c
    m\u1EA1nh (Power/ST) tr\u1EDF l\xEAn. Hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng n\xE0y \xE9p \u0111\u1ED1i
    th\u1EE7 kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng b\xE0i nh\u1ECF \u0111\u1EE1 \u0111\xF2n.\r\n<b><color=#FFD166>-
    [Play] (\u0110\xE1nh ra/Tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i):</color></b> Hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng
    \u0111i k\xE8m s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t ngay l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c
    t\u1EA1i th\u1EDDi \u0111i\u1EC3m ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i \u0111\xE1nh l\xE1
    b\xE0i \u0111\xF3 t\u1EEB tr\xEAn tay xu\u1ED1ng b\xE0n \u0111\u1EA5u.\r\n<b><color=#FFD166>-
    [Can\u2019t block] (Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 th\u1EE7):</color></b> Qu\xE2n b\xE0i mang
    tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i n\xE0y ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 tham gia t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng,
    ho\xE0n to\xE0n kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c k\xE9o xu\u1ED1ng h\xE0ng
    ph\xF2ng ng\u1EF1 \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1EB7n \u0111\xF2n.\r\n<b><color=#FFD166>-
    [Last Breath] (Tr\xFAt H\u01A1i T\xE0n):</color></b> Hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng \u0111\u1EB7c
    bi\u1EC7t s\u1EBD ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t v\xE0o \u0111\xFAng
    th\u1EDDi \u0111i\u1EC3m qu\xE2n b\xE0i n\xE0y b\u1ECB ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t (ch\u1EBFt)
    tr\xEAn b\xE0n \u0111\u1EA5u.\r\n<b><color=#FFD166>- [Ephemeral] (Ph\xF9 Du):</color></b>
    L\xE1 b\xE0i t\u1ED3n t\u1EA1i t\u1EA1m th\u1EDDi. N\xF3 s\u1EBD t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng
    ch\u1EBFt ngay sau khi th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n xong m\u1ED9t \u0111\xF2n t\u1EA5n
    c\xF4ng, ho\u1EB7c ngay khi v\xF2ng \u0111\u1EA5u (round) hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i
    k\u1EBFt th\xFAc.\r\n<b><color=#FFD166>- [Lifesteal] (H\xFAt M\xE1u):</color></b>
    M\u1ECDi s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng m\xE0 qu\xE2n b\xE0i n\xE0y g\xE2y ra (d\xF9
    l\xE0 \u0111\xE1nh qu\xE2n \u0111\u1ECBch hay \u0111\xE1nh tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp
    Nh\xE0 ch\xEDnh) \u0111\u1EC1u s\u1EBD h\u1ED3i l\u1EA1i l\u01B0\u1EE3ng m\xE1u
    t\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0111\u01B0\u01A1ng cho Nh\xE0 ch\xEDnh (Nexus) c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n."
